      "writtenOn": "2025-08-18T19:54:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Maybe not directly by Gerrit, but plugins may still generate events. For instance, the pull-replication plugin would still notify that it managed to replicate a project deletion *after* the deletion was completed.\n\nAlso, it looks like Shawn did explicitly check for project existence and returning `false` in `isVisible()` in I478119601.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 10,
        "startChar": 29,
        "endLine": 11,
        "endChar": 17
      },
      "revId": "45d977f5436d1e0c7f267e9d4eb95a74bb9ff9ff",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "534ee5e8_20a910e4",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 11,
      "author": {
        "id": 1003935
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-08-19T06:21:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sending an event after the project has been deleted is fine. I don\u0027t understand how removing the check for the project state (that would have failed if the project is deleted) would break this?",
      "parentUuid": "54b6d406_b4ea0326",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 10,
        "startChar": 29,
        "endLine": 11,
        "endChar": 17
      },
      "revId": "45d977f5436d1e0c7f267e9d4eb95a74bb9ff9ff",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "90c634ef_0c734822",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 11,
      "author": {
        "id": 1003935
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-08-19T06:25:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "With the old code isVisibleTo was returning false if the project did not exist, hence this event was never be send, wasn\u0027t it?",
      "parentUuid": "534ee5e8_20a910e4",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 10,
        "startChar": 29,
        "endLine": 11,
        "endChar": 17
      },
      "revId": "45d977f5436d1e0c7f267e9d4eb95a74bb9ff9ff",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f253be5c_4d933290",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 11,
      "author": {
        "id": 1003935
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-08-19T06:51:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Restoring the old behaviour in regards to checking the project existence in https://gerrit-review.git.corp.google.com/c/gerrit/+/499169.\n\nStill not sure how sending the project deletion event worked at all.",
      "parentUuid": "90c634ef_0c734822",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 10,
        "startChar": 29,
        "endLine": 11,
        "endChar": 17
      },
      "revId": "45d977f5436d1e0c7f267e9d4eb95a74bb9ff9ff",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
