      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-08-18T19:54:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I believe we still have to, or, alternatively, catching the exception and returning `false`, similarly to what `isVisibleTo(Project.NameKey project, CurrentUser user)` does, catching `PermissionBackendException` and returning false.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 12,
        "startChar": 68,
        "endLine": 13,
